  "content": "<p>Это не оригинальный мод. Оригинальный мод Better Block Sounds от Ordana вы можете найти <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-block-sounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">здесь</a>.</p><p>Отличия:</p><ul>\n<li>Поддержка современных версий</li>\n<li>Отсутствие зависимости от API Architectury</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1232054.svg\" alt=\"versions\"></p><p>С обновления 1.2.0 добавлена поддержка тегов. Теперь вы можете добавлять дополнительные блоки в теги. См. <a href=\"https://github.com/ludwici/BetterBlockSounds/tree/1.21.1/src/generated/resources/data/bbsf/tags/block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">список тегов</a>.</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/blob/main/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"neoforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"fabric\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"patreon-singular\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\" alt=\"kofi-singular\"></a></p><p>Посмотрите мои другие моды:<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G1XpmL4.png\" alt=\"carpet-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c2kJqYK/copperdeco125.png\" alt=\"copper-deco\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-loot-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n1X16BM.png\" alt=\"mob-loot-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slime-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/7LPXcWkr/so-logo-mini.png\" alt=\"slime-overhaul\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polyglot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3RCh0RZ/polyglot-mini.jpg\" alt=\"polyglot\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/hytale/mods/weapon-mastery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/C1fM4HHC/WM125.jpg\" alt=\"weapon-mastery\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NMB0gG5S/icon.png\" alt=\"bigwater\"></a></p>",
